  "title": "Karen Green and David Priebe Join Hamilton Board of Directors",
  "summary": "PEMBROKE, BERMUDA, May 19, 2025 — Hamilton Insurance Group, Ltd. (NYSE: HG) (“Hamilton” or the “Company”) announced today that Karen Green and David Priebe have been appointed to the Company’s Board of Directors, effective May 15, 2025. The Company also announced the retirement of long-standing Director Bill Freda, also effective May 15, 2025. Freda has […]",
